        {
          "statement": "来源关键位包括卖出区 0.66~1.1、买入区 0.33~-0.11、陷阱区 0.89~1.1 与 0.11~-0.11，以及 0.21/0.79 竞争位。",
          "declaration_type": "source_assertion",
          "supporting_chunk_keys": [
            "definition-zones"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "recognition_features": [
        {
          "statement": "在一个大的震荡区间内出现 Mother Bar 时，交易策略是高抛低吸，进行剥头皮交易。",
          "declaration_type": "source_assertion",
          "supporting_chunk_keys": [
            "definition-zones"
          ]
        },
        {
          "statement": "上涨趋势前两波上涨（第一、二条腿）中，可以利用买入区挂限价单加入趋势。",
          "declaration_type": "source_assertion",
          "supporting_chunk_keys": [
            "contexts-confirmation-risk"
          ]
        },
        {
          "statement": "上涨趋势前两波中应避免在卖出区做空，因为这相当于逆势交易。",
          "declaration_type": "source_assertion",
          "supporting_chunk_keys": [
            "contexts-confirmation-risk"
          ]
        },
        {
          "statement": "下跌趋势中利用卖出区做空，避免在买入区抄底。",
          "declaration_type": "source_assertion",
          "supporting_chunk_keys": [
            "contexts-confirmation-risk"
          ]
        },
        {
          "statement": "上涨趋势末端的 Wedge Top 使用卖出区做空并忽略买入区做多；下跌趋势末端的 Wedge Bottom 使用买入区积极做多。",
          "declaration_type": "source_assertion",
          "supporting_chunk_keys": [
            "contexts-confirmation-risk"
          ]
        }
